speechtext:
Mr. Speaker, the Conservatives wasted an hour of the time of the House this afternoon with flimsy questions of privilege and points of order. I hope the time taken by the hon. member in raising this latest flimsy point will not be considered part of my time.
I am not attributing any intentions to the Conservatives. I am reading their own motion, which says;
That this House condemns the Government's National Energy Program-
